<title>UK: DePfa sets $200 million December 1998 bond, +14 bp.</title>
<headline>DePfa sets $200 million December 1998 bond, +14 bp.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Commerzbank and Nomura.</p>
<p> BORROWER  DEUTSCHE PFANDBRIEF- UND HYPOTHEKENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	COUPON     6.375     MATURITY    30.DEC.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.855   PAY DATE  L-17.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.25	REOFFER    99.755    SPREAD	+14 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	L LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.15	SELL CONC  =	   PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND TWO-YEAR U.S. TREASURY</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
